# Generated by the pipeline (python -m pipeline.build_dataset); rebuild locally.
# The municipalities offered for playtesting are tracked (and listed in index.json), so a fresh clone
# and the deploy run the game without the pipeline. The pipeline's `write_index()` rescans
# app/public/data/ and regenerates index.json with every locally built municipality in it — trim it
# back to the tracked ones before committing.
app/public/data/*
!app/public/data/index.json
!app/public/data/schlieren.json
!app/public/data/bonstetten.json
!app/public/data/regensdorf.json
!app/public/data/uster.json
!app/public/data/wadenswil.json
!app/public/data/wetzikon-zh.json
# Par (sim/par.ts): computed with the game, not the pipeline — committed.
!app/public/data/par/
